If I check this three months later,

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:31.010
it probably be even below 200,

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.620
which is ideally where we want it to be.

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:34.830
So now I have to keep my cholesterol low

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:37.100
